<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money shortage drops to 7.8 bln rand Fri.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money shortage drops to 7.8 bln rand Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage dropped to 7.783 billion rand on Friday from 8.955 billion rand on Thursday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
